错"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "圆与直线/圆的关系判断错误"}]}]}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "borderColor": "#3b82f6", "icon": "📊"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "刷题建议：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "圆和扇形的公式必须熟记。注意角度单位是度不是弧度。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '数量关系-几何问题-圆与扇形的核心知识点和解题方法。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "几何问题", "圆与扇形"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_geo_circle_sector", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
